{"version":1,"content":"<p>一項由佛羅裏達國際大學研究人員主導、發表於《自然通訊》的研究發現，墨西哥灣五種生活在海面下數百米的深海生物出現與滅絕風險升高相關的遺傳信號。研究團隊分析了2011年至2023年間採集的三種燈籠魚和兩種深海蝦，共486個樣本的遺傳數據，並結合生態位模型評估其種羣變化與未來栖息地狀況。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1586884.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T06:26:51.189994+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T06:03:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T06:20:10.289037+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T06:20:10.289037+00:00","content_hash":"4716573594d6a2c065aaa52815fb724ff434b47fcd07490d06b94637cf3ef481","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}